<rml>
<head>
	<title>Cursor sheet (native tactical wireframe)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../components.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../screens/tactical.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="mocks.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- Wireframe for docs/plan/native-tactical.md, drawn over the live tactical HUD in the real game
     (tests/e2e/manual/native_tactical_mocks.lua). Literal data. Generated by tools/ui/native_tactical_mocks.py:
     edit the generator, not this file. -->
<body class="t5 mock">
<div class="t5-root">
	<div class="sheet hud">
		<div class="hud-head"><img class="icon sm" src="icon-pointer"/><span class="t" style="margin-left: 8dp;">Tactical cursors</span><span class="m">one native pointer for every mode, at output resolution · small text: the legacy cursor ids it replaces</span></div>
		<div class="body">
			<div class="grid"><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-walk"/><div class="dm"></div></div><span class="n">Walk</span><span class="s">MOVE_WALK · CONFIRM · ALL</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-run"/><div class="dm"></div></div><span class="n">Run</span><span class="s">MOVE_RUN · REALTIME</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-sneak"/><div class="dm"></div></div><span class="n">Sneak</span><span class="s">MOVE_SWAT</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-stance-prone"/><div class="dm"></div></div><span class="n">Crawl</span><span class="s">MOVE_PRONE</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-vehicle"/><div class="dm"></div></div><span class="n">Drive</span><span class="s">MOVE_VEHICLE</span></div><div class="cur no"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-error"/><div class="dm"></div></div><span class="n">No path</span><span class="s">CANNOT_MOVE</span></div><div class="cur foe"><div class="pic"><div class="rt"></div><img class="icon sm" src="icon-target"/></div><span class="n">Fire</span><span class="s">ACTION_SHOOT</span></div><div class="cur foe"><div class="pic"><div class="rt"></div><div class="pip" style="left: 70dp;"></div><div class="pip" style="left: 80dp;"></div></div><span class="n">Aim +2</span><span class="s">TARGETAIM1..9</span></div><div class="cur foe"><div class="pic"><div class="rt"></div><img class="icon sm" src="icon-burst"/></div><span class="n">Burst</span><span class="s">TARGETBURST · CONFIRM</span></div><div class="cur foe"><div class="pic"><div class="rt"></div><img class="icon sm" src="icon-fast-forward"/></div><span class="n">Autofire</span><span class="s">(new: role-gated auto)</span></div><div class="cur no"><div class="pic"><div class="rt"></div><img class="icon sm" src="icon-error"/></div><span class="n">No chance</span><span class="s">NOCHANCE · AIMCANT</span></div><div class="cur warn"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-reload"/></div><span class="n">Reloading</span><span class="s">TARGET_RELOADING</span></div><div class="cur foe"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-punch"/></div><span class="n">Punch</span><span class="s">PUNCH_GRAY / RED / AIM</span></div><div class="cur foe"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-blade"/></div><span class="n">Knife</span><span class="s">KNIFE_REG / HIT / AIM</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-throw"/></div><span class="n">Throw</span><span class="s">ACTION_TOSS</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-launcher"/></div><span class="n">Launch</span><span class="s">ACTION_FLASH_TOSS</span></div><div class="cur no"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-throw"/></div><span class="n">Out of reach</span><span class="s">ACTION_RED_TOSS</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-medkit"/></div><span class="n">Bandage</span><span class="s">ACTION_FIRSTAID</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-pointer"/></div><span class="n">Pick up / use</span><span class="s">NORMAL / OKHANDCURSOR</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-door"/></div><span class="n">Open door</span><span class="s">ACTION_OPEN</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-talk"/></div><span class="n">Talk</span><span class="s">TALK_A</span></div><div class="cur warn"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-talk"/></div><span class="n">Talk: too far</span><span class="s">TALK_OUT_RANGE</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-trade"/></div><span class="n">Give</span><span class="s">(catch / give)</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-repair"/></div><span class="n">Repair · use kit</span><span class="s">(item on item)</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-climb"/></div><span class="n">Climb</span><span class="s">(roof edge)</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-up"/></div><span class="n">Jump over</span><span class="s">JUMP (fence)</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-look"/></div><span class="n">Look / turn</span><span class="s">LOOK</span></div><div class="cur ok"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-exit-sector"/></div><span class="n">Leave sector</span><span class="s">EXIT_N/S/E/W · GRID</span></div><div class="cur no"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-exit-sector"/></div><span class="n">Can't leave</span><span class="s">NOEXIT_N/S/E/W</span></div><div class="cur warn"><div class="pic"><img class="icon" src="icon-wait"/></div><span class="n">Busy</span><span class="s">(UI locked)</span></div></div>
			<div class="side">
				<span class="cap">Tone</span>
				<div class="tones"><span><span class="sw" style="background-color: #D9A54A;"></span>can do</span><span><span class="sw" style="background-color: #E0B040;"></span>with a catch</span><span><span class="sw" style="background-color: #B0442E;"></span>hostile / can't</span></div>
				<p>The shape says what a click does; the chip next to it says what it costs. Move cursors put a marker on the tile; the turn-based "confirm" click fills the marker instead of swapping bitmaps.</p>
				<span class="cap">Target chip</span>
				<div class="chip2 no"><span class="h">Fire at Soldier · torso</span><div class="l"><span class="k">Hit</span><span class="v">64 %</span></div><div class="l"><span class="k">AP</span><span class="v ok">6 · aim +2: 8</span></div><div class="l"><span class="k">Range</span><span class="v">14 tiles</span></div><span class="hint">RMB: aim more · B: burst</span></div>
				<span class="cap">Move chip</span>
				<div class="chip2"><span class="h">Run</span><div class="l"><span class="k">AP</span><span class="v ok">12 · 6 left</span></div><span class="hint">beyond this turn: amber path</span></div>
				<span class="cap">Interaction chip</span>
				<div class="chip2 warn"><span class="h">Door · locked</span><div class="l"><span class="k">Lockpick</span><span class="v">5 AP</span></div><span class="hint">click: the door menu</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
